{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788242024879,"sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8881e876ed9ffe34","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"\n brazilian_soccer_mcp - MCP server & knowledge graph for Brazilian soccer.\n\n Package layout (see module docstrings for the full design notes):\n\n * normalizer.py - team/competition/date normalisation (alias tables).\n * loader.py     - loads the six Kaggle CSVs, dedups overlapping fixtures,\n                  builds the club registry and all indexes.\n * models.py     - Match / Player / Club / StandingRow dataclasses.\n * queries.py    - every capability required by the spec (one function each).\n * render.py     - human-formatted answers (shared by MCP tools and CLI).\n * tools.py      - MCP tool catalogue + dispatch.\n * server.py     - MCP stdio server (newline-delimited JSON-RPC 2.0).\n * cli.py        - direct command-line access to the same queries.\n\n Run the MCP server:  python -m brazilian_soccer_mcp\n Run the CLI:         python -m brazilian_soccer_mcp.cli --help\n Run the tests:       python -m pytest\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom .loader import Dataset, load_dataset\n\n__version__ = \"1.0.0\"\n\n__all__ = [\"Dataset\", \"load_dataset\", \"__version__\"]\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"brazilian_soccer_mcp/__init__.py","time":{"start":1788242024875,"end":1788242024878}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_05b87cc4e001wDktyPOrl9Ehv2","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","messageID":"msg_05b87c4c40012GUsyuxuP0UoDL"}}
