r in group:\n    if other is original_best_ref: continue\n    _backfill(best, other)\n```\nBut `other is best` — best is now a copy, so no group element IS best. Simplify: iterate all others and backfill. Also `_same_fixture` signature: I changed the call to `_same_fixture(existing, candidate, league=False)` but the function takes `league: bool` — passing league=False fine. But the `league` param docs... keep.\n\nAlso there's a subtlety: `_best_league_row` picks first-with-goals — for 2022 NA rows the brf row wins; backfill round from bras NA sibling ✓ (bras NA has round 30+). \n\nFix the silly condition. Also update `_same_fixture` docstring mention. And `_drop_mislabeled_league_rows` must be called in load_dataset AFTER pass 2 (keys resolved) and BEFORE _dedup. Update load_dataset.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b8afc8a001zUH33fTlieOBZa","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","messageID":"msg_05b8addf6001OElT7gS52goiIQ"}}
