{"type":"text","timestamp":1788242426715,"sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","part":{"id":"prt_05b8dee10001D5rHhHxkq1uCsJ","messageID":"msg_05b8dac28001ecGpzexU31UdN0","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","type":"text","text":"All resolutions correct. Now writing the BDD/GWT test suite — conftest plus the nine test modules:","time":{"start":1788242423312,"end":1788242426714}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788242426719,"sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-ae605499ee92d43d","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"\"\"\"\nShared fixtures for the Brazilian Soccer MCP test suite.\n\nThe dataset (≈33k CSV rows) loads in under a second, but a session-scoped\nfixture keeps every scenario running against one in-memory graph.\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport pytest\n\n# Ensure the repository root is importable when pytest runs from anywhere.\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent\nif str(ROOT) not in sys.path:\n    sys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\n\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp import Dataset, load_dataset  # noqa: E402\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef ds() -> Dataset:\n    \"\"\"The whole knowledge graph, loaded once per test session.\"\"\"\n    return load_dataset()\n\n\n@pytest.fixture(scope=\"session\")\ndef ds_timed() -> tuple[Dataset, float]:\n    \"\"\"Dataset plus its load time in seconds (performance scenarios).\"\"\"\n    import time\n\n    started = time.perf_counter()\n    dataset = load_dataset()\n    return dataset, time.perf_counter() - started\n","filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/conftest.py"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/conftest.py","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tests/conftest.py","time":{"start":1788242426711,"end":1788242426717}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"All country resolutions now correct. Total matches unchanged (16717) — the 'nacional uru|' phantoms were Libertadores-only (no cross-source dedup impact).\n\nNow write the test suite. Directory `tests/` with:\n- conftest.py — session-scoped `ds` fixture + helpers.\n- test_normalizer.py\n- test_loader.py\n- test_queries_matches.py\n- test_queries_teams.py\n- test_queries_players.py\n- test_queries_competitions.py\n- test_queries_stats.py\n- test_sample_questions.py\n- test_server.py\n\nKey assertions from validated facts:\n- Serie A seasons: 2003:552, 2004:552, 2005:462, 2006-2022:380, 2009:379, 2023:377.\n- 2019 table: Flamengo 90 (28/6/4, 86/37), Santos 74 (22/8/8), Palmeiras 74 (21/11/6); relegated Cruzeiro, CSA, Chapecoense, Avaí.\n- 2018 champ Palmeiras 80; relegated Sport, América Mineiro, Vitória, Paraná.\n- 2020 champ Flamengo 71; relegated Vasco, Goiás, Coritiba, Botafogo.\n- 2021 champ Atlético Mineiro 84; relegated Grêmio, Bahia, Sport, Chapecoense.\n- Corinthians home 2022: 19 matches, 12W 4D 3L, GF 24, GA 11, win rate 63.2.\n- Fla-Flu h2h: 44 meetings, 18-14-12 (a=Flamengo).\n- Palmeiras-Santos h2h: 41 played, 17-8-16.\n- Copa finals: seasons 2012-2020 with exactly 2 matches each; 2019 final: Athletico Paranaense vs Internacional (Athletico won: 1-0 home + 2-1 away).\n- Libertadores finals: 2019 Flamengo 2-1 River Plate; 2020 Palmeiras 1-0 Santos; 2017 Grêmio champion (1-0, 2-1 away); unplayed row season None.\n- biggest wins: São Paulo 9-1 4 de Julho (copa 2021, margin 8); River Plate 8-0 Jorge Wilstermann (2017).\n- Serie A 2019 stats: avg 2.31, home 48.4%, draw 25.8%, away 25.8%; 380 matches.\n- Serie A overall: avg 2.57, home 49.7.\n- best away (serie_a, min 100): Cruzeiro 33.0 (352).\n- best home: Grêmio 59.1 (369).\n- derbies 2023: 10 with matches; Fla-Flu 2023: 4 meetings.\n- Palmeiras 2023: 43 matches (37 serie_a + 6 copa).\n- Palmeiras profile: 3 competitions, 888 matches, 422 wins; fifa players 0.\n- Players: 18207 total; Brazil 827; top Brazilian Neymar Jr 92; Grêmio club 20 players (Josué Chiamulera 83 top?); São Paulo club: 0; Juventus: 25, CR7 94.\n- player_club_report(nationality=Brazil): Atlético Mineiro 20 players avg 73.5 (top Brazilian-club row).\n- resolve: full names, suffixes, accents (from the run above).\n- Copa do Brasil 2021: no final detectable.\n- 2023 standings: 20 rows; Grêmio 68 pts (data truth; note in test that 2023 comes solely from BR-Football).\n\nMCP server tests:\n- initialize → protocolVersion echo, capabilities, serverInfo.\n- tools/list: 14 tools, each has name/description/inputSchema with type object.\n- tools/call search_matches → content text + structuredContent, no isError.\n- tools/call unknown team → isError true.\n- unknown tool → JSON-RPC error -32602.\n- unknown method → -32601.\n- notification → None.\n- pre-init request → -32002.\n- resources/list/read.\n- ping.\n- parse error line → -32700.\n- batch array.\n- End-to-end subprocess: initialize/initialized/tools list + call.\n\nSample questions (≥20): parametrized list mapping TASK.md's sample tables.\n\nPerformance tests: simple lookup < 2s, aggregate < 5s, load < 10s (generous to avoid flake).\n\nNow — one more thing to double check: the `player_search` club filter for 'Grêmio' worked (20 players). And FIFA club \"Atlético Mineiro\" → resolve alias → atletico|MG ✓ (report shows Atlético Mineiro row with 20 players ✓).\n\nAlso `search_matches` with stage='final' competition='copa_do_brasil' season=2021 → should return 0 matches (no final detected) + ok. And standings for copa → error. list_teams serie_a 2019 → 20.\n\nAlso CLI test: run `python -m brazilian_soccer_mcp.cli standings serie_a 2019` via subprocess in tests? Adds runtime (dataset load ~0.8s per invocation). Worth one CLI smoke test. And `--help` exits 0 without loading data? argparse help exits before load ✓ quick.\n\nNote about pytest config: pyproject.toml with pythonpath=[\".\"] and testpaths. pytest 9.1.1 installed ✓ supports pythonpath ini.\n\nLet me write conftest + normalizer/loader tests first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b8def430018XNAFnPnty8DKp","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","messageID":"msg_05b8dac28001ecGpzexU31UdN0"}}
