{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788242600644,"sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-add529d76693998e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp import load_dataset\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import team_stats, last_match_between, search_matches\nds = load_dataset()\nts = team_stats(ds, 'Chapecoense', season=2016, competition='serie_a')\nprint(\"Chapecoense 2016 serie_a:\", ts['record'])\n# find a never-met pair among prominent clubs\ncands = [('Flamengo','Sampaio Corrêa'), ('Palmeiras','Nacional (URU)'), ('Corinthians','River Plate-URU'),\n         ('São Paulo','Fast Clube'), ('Flamengo','Juazeirense')]\nfor a,b in cands:\n    r = search_matches(ds, team=a, opponent=b)\n    print(a, \"vs\", b, \"->\", r['total'])\nlm = last_match_between(ds, 'Flamengo', 'Sampaio Corrêa')\nprint(\"lm:\", lm['ok'], lm.get('error'))\nEOF"},"output":"Chapecoense 2016 serie_a: {'matches': 38, 'wins': 13, 'draws': 14, 'losses': 11, 'goals_for': 49, 'goals_against': 53, 'win_rate': 34.2}\nFlamengo vs Sampaio Corrêa -> 0\nPalmeiras vs Nacional (URU) -> 2\nCorinthians vs River Plate-URU -> 0\nSão Paulo vs Fast Clube -> 0\nFlamengo vs Juazeirense -> 0\nlm: False No matches between Flamengo and Sampaio Corrêa in the dataset.\n","metadata":{"output":"Chapecoense 2016 serie_a: {'matches': 38, 'wins': 13, 'draws': 14, 'losses': 11, 'goals_for': 49, 'goals_against': 53, 'win_rate': 34.2}\nFlamengo vs Sampaio Corrêa -> 0\nPalmeiras vs Nacional (URU) -> 2\nCorinthians vs River Plate-URU -> 0\nSão Paulo vs Fast Clube -> 0\nFlamengo vs Juazeirense -> 0\nlm: False No matches between Flamengo and Sampaio Corrêa in the dataset.\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp import load_dataset\nfrom brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import team_stats, last_match_between, search_matches\nds = load_dataset()\nts = team_stats(ds, 'Chapecoense', season=2016, competition='serie_a')\nprint(\"Chapecoense 2016 serie_a:\", ts['record'])\n# find a never-met pair among prominent clubs\ncands = [('Flamengo','Sampaio Corrêa'), ('Palmeiras','Nacional (URU)'), ('Corinthians','River Plate-URU'),\n         ('São Paulo','Fast Clube'), ('Flamengo','Juazeirense')]\nfor a,b in cands:\n    r = search_matches(ds, team=a, opponent=b)\n    print(a, \"vs\", b, \"->\", r['total'])\nlm = last_match_between(ds, 'Flamengo', 'Sampaio Corrêa')\nprint(\"lm:\", lm['ok'], lm.get('error'))\nEOF","time":{"start":1788242600616,"end":1788242600640}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Two test-affecting findings:\n1. **Grêmio vs CSA head_to_head returns ok=True!** — they HAVE met (CSA played Série A 2019? No... Grêmio vs CSA — cup? Copa do Brasil 2012? CSA (AL) vs Grêmio? Possibly met in Copa do Brasil. So my test `test_last_match_pair_without_history` using Grêmio-CSA is WRONG (they have history). Also `last_match_between(Grêmio, CSA)` — hmm the earlier test asserted not ok. Pick a pair that truly never met. Let me find one: e.g. \"Flamengo\" vs \"Sampaio Corrêa\"? or \"Palmeiras\" vs \"Nacional (URU)\"? Let me search for a never-met pair programmatically.\n\n2. team_stats import missing in that snippet (my bad, not code bug).\n\nLet me find a valid never-met pair and check Chapecoense 2016 record (their unplayed match should make record consistent).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b9095e0001u8FEq63HlXbVrr","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","messageID":"msg_05b908214001rDnne1iZkHhhuL"}}
