{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788242754774,"sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-b7b6a8ef59861934","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py","newString":"from brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import (\n    best_records,\n    biggest_wins,\n    competition_stats,\n    derbies,\n    head_to_head,\n    last_match_between,\n    player_club_report,\n    player_search,\n    search_matches,\n    standings,\n    team_profile,\n    team_stats,\n)","oldString":"from brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import (\n    best_records,\n    competition_stats,\n    derbies,\n    head_to_head,\n    last_match_between,\n    player_club_report,\n    player_search,\n    search_matches,\n    standings,\n    team_profile,\n    team_stats,\n)"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n@@ -11,8 +11,9 @@\n import pytest\n \n from brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import (\n     best_records,\n+    biggest_wins,\n     competition_stats,\n     derbies,\n     head_to_head,\n     last_match_between,\n","filediff":{"file":"/Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py","patch":"Index: /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n+++ /Users/maui/.retort/work/retort-local-7ooj92cj/retort-7a36b7336902/tests/test_sample_questions.py\n@@ -11,8 +11,9 @@\n import pytest\n \n from brazilian_soccer_mcp.queries import (\n     best_records,\n+    biggest_wins,\n     competition_stats,\n     derbies,\n     head_to_head,\n     last_match_between,\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"tests/test_sample_questions.py","time":{"start":1788242754772,"end":1788242754773}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Wait — test_team_season_completeness: Flamengo 2019 all comps = 38 serie_a + libertadores 2019 (Flamengo played lib 2019: 12-13 matches?) + copa do brasil 2019 (Flamengo played cup 2019? YES — they lost the final? no wait, Flamengo won the 2019 Libertadores; in Copa do Brasil 2019 they played until semis?). So team_stats(season only) would count ALL competitions → NOT 38. And Corinthians 2022: serie_a 38 + copa 2022 ( Corinthians played cup 2022 ✓) → >38. My parametrized values are wrong unless scoped. Fix: scope competition='serie_a' for Flamengo/Corinthians; Palmeiras 2023 has no libertadores (they played lib 2023? Palmeiras 2023 in our data: serie_a 37 + copa 6 = 43 — no libertadores rows for 2023 (lib file ends 2022) ✓ so 43 unscoped). Let me fix the parametrize to include competition.\n\nAlso the awkward `biggest_wins_local` indirection — silly; just import biggest_wins at top. Let me clean both.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b92f6e5001jTInYQ5xwpjPVz","sessionID":"ses_fa4988af5ffe6mID1MhYqXoot3","messageID":"msg_05b92e02d001cZOLMTr5tiyheK"}}
